BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (to the local market instead of using one fixed number: 250 miles around Boise, but only 50 miles for Las) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Vegas and Salt Lake, where the nearby listing volume carries the search [JwkoiixPFmM @ 00:01:19].) Tj ET
