BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.50 Tm (together cover about 35 states, you do not need to register individually in any of them, and on the SST form) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (you can enter a home-state ID, FEIN, driver's license number, social security number, or any international) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (identification number [It-VnUi3x58 @ 00:01:15]. Kexin layers it: try the SST form first, then the MTC form,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (and only register where neither form reaches, roughly 10 to 11 states that accept no alternative) Tj ET
