BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (00:01:38]. Operator read: home-state registration is the anchor, and the multistate forms are the reach.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.70 Tm (Practitioners also disagree on which state's paper is worth holding. James Baker CPA calls Florida one of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.47 Tm (the best certificates in the country because one piece of paper goes to every vendor, while Wyoming makes) Tj ET
