BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.12 Tm (every December 31st, and an expired certificate is useless because vendors are legally required to reject it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.90 Tm ([K5oBesJVonE @ 00:07:40]. On blanket versus single-use, the camp lands in the same place for different) Tj ET
